{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Frequently Asked Questions"}], "prev": {"link": "../client-started-but-nothing-happens/", "title": "Client started, but nothing happens"}, "next": {"link": "../migrating-the-account-to-another-data-center/", "title": "Migrating the account to another data center"}, "title": "What are the IP addresses of Telegram Data Centers?", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"what-are-the-ip-addresses-of-telegram-data-centers\">\n<h1>What are the IP addresses of Telegram Data Centers?<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#what-are-the-ip-addresses-of-telegram-data-centers\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<p>Telegram is currently composed by a decentralized, multi-DC infrastructure (currently 5 DCs, each of which can\nwork independently) spread across different locations worldwide. However, some of the less busy DCs have been lately\ndismissed and their IP addresses are now kept as aliases to the nearest one.</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrapper colwidths-auto docutils container\" id=\"id1\">\n<table class=\"docutils align-center\" id=\"id1\">\n<caption><span class=\"caption-text\">Production Environment</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id1\" title=\"Link to this table\">\u00b6</a></caption>\n<thead>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><th class=\"head\"><p>ID</p></th>\n<th class=\"head\"><p>Location</p></th>\n<th class=\"head\"><p>IPv4</p></th>\n<th class=\"head\"><p>IPv6</p></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p>DC1</p></td>\n<td><p>MIA, Miami FL, USA</p></td>\n<td><p><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">149.154.175.53</span></code></p></td>\n<td><p><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">2001:b28:f23d:f001::a</span></code></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p>DC2</p></td>\n<td><p>AMS, Amsterdam, NL</p></td>\n<td><p><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">149.154.167.51</span></code></p></td>\n<td><p><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">2001:67c:4e8:f002::a</span></code></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p>DC3*</p></td>\n<td><p>MIA, Miami FL, USA</p></td>\n<td><p><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">149.154.175.100</span></code></p></td>\n<td><p><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">2001:b28:f23d:f003::a</span></code></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p>DC4</p></td>\n<td><p>AMS, Amsterdam, NL</p></td>\n<td><p><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">149.154.167.91</span></code></p></td>\n<td><p><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">2001:67c:4e8:f004::a</span></code></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p>DC5</p></td>\n<td><p>SIN, Singapore, SG</p></td>\n<td><p><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">91.108.56.130</span></code></p></td>\n<td><p><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">2001:b28:f23f:f005::a</span></code></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"table-wrapper colwidths-auto docutils container\" id=\"id2\">\n<table class=\"docutils align-center\" id=\"id2\">\n<caption><span class=\"caption-text\">Test Environment</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id2\" title=\"Link to this table\">\u00b6</a></caption>\n<thead>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><th class=\"head\"><p>ID</p></th>\n<th class=\"head\"><p>Location</p></th>\n<th class=\"head\"><p>IPv4</p></th>\n<th class=\"head\"><p>IPv6</p></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p>DC1</p></td>\n<td><p>MIA, Miami FL, USA</p></td>\n<td><p><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">149.154.175.10</span></code></p></td>\n<td><p><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">2001:b28:f23d:f001::e</span></code></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p>DC2</p></td>\n<td><p>AMS, Amsterdam, NL</p></td>\n<td><p><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">149.154.167.40</span></code></p></td>\n<td><p><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">2001:67c:4e8:f002::e</span></code></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p>DC3*</p></td>\n<td><p>MIA, Miami FL, USA</p></td>\n<td><p><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">149.154.175.117</span></code></p></td>\n<td><p><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">2001:b28:f23d:f003::e</span></code></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"centered\">\n<strong>More info about the Test Environment can be found <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../../topics/test-servers/\"><span class=\"doc\">here</span></a>.</strong></p><p><strong>*</strong> Alias DC</p>\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["faq/migrating-the-account-to-another-data-center", "Migrating the account to another data center", "N", "next"], ["faq/client-started-but-nothing-happens", "Client started, but nothing happens", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">What are the IP addresses of Telegram Data Centers?</a></li>\n</ul>\n", "display_toc": false, "page_source_suffix": ".rst", "current_page_name": "faq/what-are-the-ip-addresses-of-telegram-data-centers", "sidebars": ["sidebar/brand.html", "sidebar/search.html", "sidebar/scroll-start.html", "sidebar/navigation.html", "sidebar/scroll-end.html"], "alabaster_version": "1.0.0", "alabaster_version_info": [1, 0, 0], "furo_version": "2025.12.19", "furo_navigation_tree": "", "furo_hide_toc": true, "furo_pygments": {"light": {"background": "#eeffcc", "foreground": "black"}, "dark": {"background": "#202020", "foreground": "#d0d0d0"}}}